name>MIYAZAWA OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUNASAKA, TSUKASA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FURUHATA, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, YASUHARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIYAZAWA, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A vibration board (10) composed of a rectangular laminate of a piezoelectric element and a reinforcement member is supported on a base by means of a support (11). The support (11) elastically urges the vibration board toward a rotor (100) so that a projection (36) provided on the vibration board (10) may come into contact with the periphery of the rotor (100). When the vibration board (10) is vibrated to the right and left by the application of voltage from a driver circuit (not shown), the rotor (100) rotates clockwise with the displacement of the projection (36).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une plaque vibrante (10) constituée d'un stratifié rectangulaire d'un élément piézo-électrique et d'un élément de renforcement, et posée sur un socle par un support (11). Le support (11) exerce une pression élastique sur la plaque vibrante pour la pousser vers un rotor (100), de sorte qu'une projection (36) ménagée sur la plaque vibrante (10) puisse venir au contact de la périphérie du rotor (100). Lorsque la plaque vibrante (10) est vibré de droite à gauche par application d'une tension délivrée par un circuit de commande (non présenté), le rotor (100) effectue une rotation dans le sens des aiguilles d'une montre suivant en cela le mouvement de la projection (36).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>